							singleType="STRING";
							value="My dear Samira,<br/><br/>The nights here are cold and the food is poor, but I am well. Tell the children their father thinks of them every day. I will bring the winter pay home as soon as it comes, and we will fix the roof before the snow.<br/><br/>The captain says the supply drop comes this week, so maybe there will be a little extra for us. I will send you what I can with the next convoy. I will write more when";
